### Settlements — CREATE (expects 201 Created; amount computed from the recycler's weighings in the period)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@recyclerId = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recyclerId": {{recyclerId}},
  "periodStart": "2026-08-01",
  "periodEnd": "2026-09-30",
  "observations": "Liquidación de agosto y septiembre"
}

### Settlements — CREATE overlapping a live settlement of the same recycler (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recyclerId": {{recyclerId}},
  "periodStart": "2026-09-15",
  "periodEnd": "2026-10-01"
}

### Settlements — CREATE sending amount (expects 400 Bad Request: the server computes it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recyclerId": {{recyclerId}},
  "periodStart": "2026-07-01",
  "periodEnd": "2026-07-31",
  "amount": 1000000
}
